  "description": "Protocol Model (SM-IR Layer 0): entity-centric typed inventory of Ethereum CL Req/Resp methods. Drives the validator's payload type-check (gate 3) and the smgen fields-kind payload codegen. Request 'container' is one of: fixed (all-fixed-size SSZ fields, fields-codegen supported), variable (offset-encoded SSZ list/variable container, use a named builder), none (no request body). Bare-scalar requests (Ping/Goodbye) are modelled as single-field fixed containers. Cross-check protocol IDs against internal/constants/spec.go.",
